{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "the priority map which is behind every top closer agent schedule", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "To train real estate agents to effectively manage time and increase productivity."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "I will put my calendar on the screen so you can copy that.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "Provide an hour-by-hour schedule for a closing agent."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "priority map which is behind every top closer agent schedule", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "Explain the priority map concept."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I will share with you three things in this video...priority map which is behind every top closer agent schedule", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "Share with viewers a structured schedule and priority map to overcome time management issues."}, "title": "Managing Time for Real Estate Success", "topic": "time management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:7e038394718c13f2", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Managing Time for Real Estate Success", "topic": "time management", "topic_slug": "time-management"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Any task that carries zero chance of rejection instantly feels urgent. That's why agents update the serum in the most productive time and send the message instead of calling.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000008"}], "text": "Agents should avoid procrastination by identifying non-urgent tasks perceived as urgent due to the lack of rejection, such as updating CRM or sending messages."}, "title": "Avoid Procrastination", "topic": "task management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:1e2d70cdda14a3cc", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Avoid Procrastination", "topic": "task management", "topic_slug": "task-management"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Because right now the only product you're selling is your ability to hold the conversation about real estate under pressure.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009"}], "text": "To prepare new agents to handle real estate conversations under pressure."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "One zone takes half of your week. Education, market knowledge, and product knowledge.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009"}], "text": "Spend half of the week on education, market, and product knowledge."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "map of the city where the public transfer is going in the next five years.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "Map important city and developer data."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Every week you build two presentations.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "Create and practice presentations weekly."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "write the speaker notes, then you record yourself exactly like this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000011"}], "text": "Develop confidence through self-assessment with recording."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you under six months in, your day should not look like a top producer in your team. Copying his calendar is the fastest way to quit this industry.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009"}], "text": "Develop a weekly schedule for real estate agents under six months."}, "title": "Six-Month Agent Schedule", "topic": "new agent schedule"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:85e932ac390a950f", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Six-Month Agent Schedule", "topic": "new agent schedule", "topic_slug": "new-agent-schedule"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000024"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "money making activities become the priority. Not something you fit, something that you all week is build around.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"}], "text": "To ensure that money-making activities are prioritized in the weekly schedule."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "It's two blocks a day, forty-five minutes each. Eight blocks in your week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020"}], "text": "Dedicate two daily time blocks to dialing prospective clients."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Two blocks every morning. And they're going into the empty calendar before anything else exists.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"}], "text": "Place calls before any other task in the calendar."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Wednesday afternoon is the only block in this week that isn't a conversation. It's a content and one hour listening back to your own calls.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000024"}], "text": "Group client meetings in the afternoon or evening and focus on content review on Wednesday afternoons."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "This is what changes when your schedule is after your first six months. Your money making activities become the priority.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"}], "text": "After six months, a real estate agent should prioritize money-making activities in their schedule."}, "title": "Time Management Changes After Six Months", "topic": "experienced agent schedule"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:d9992fd1a66920a5", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Time Management Changes After Six Months", "topic": "experienced agent schedule", "topic_slug": "experienced-agent-schedule"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000012"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "You studied three projects. You build the slides, you practice it loud. That is content.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000012"}], "text": "Agents should create educational content by studying real estate projects, building slides, and practicing speaking to build meaningful content."}, "title": "Purpose of Educational Content", "topic": "content development"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:a012130f4f994ae8", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Purpose of Educational Content", "topic": "content development", "topic_slug": "content-development"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000014", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000015", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000016", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000017"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "You have to learn in other markets, Thailand, Bali because you're investors comparing you to them.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000016"}], "text": "Learn about other markets as they relate to investor interest."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "You have to analyze the week you had and set the priority for the week head.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000017"}], "text": "Set priorities for the coming week based on admin activities."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Three zones. Everything you do lands in one of them. Number one, money made..", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000014"}], "text": "Utilize a priority map to determine where tasks fall within three zones: money-making, education, and admin."}, "title": "Using a Priority Map", "topic": "priority management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:70596ce2f37ff07a", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Using a Priority Map", "topic": "priority management", "topic_slug": "priority-management"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000025"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "green is a conversation with a human being who could buy. That's most of your week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000025"}], "text": "Focus on human interactions for the majority of the week."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "gray is the admin and the fires. The path that you can currently do all day.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000025"}], "text": "Label admin tasks clearly to distinguish them from productive interactions."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "green is a conversation with a human being who could buy. That's most of your week. The gray is the admin and the fires.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000025"}], "text": "Build a weekly schedule with a balance of client interactions and administrative tasks."}, "title": "Building a Weekly Schedule for Agents", "topic": "real estate scheduling"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:d984a0fcec2cdf29", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Building a Weekly Schedule for Agents", "topic": "real estate scheduling", "topic_slug": "real-estate-scheduling"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000026"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "rigid, impossible in this market. But look again, you're not planning eight hours, you're protecting six", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000026"}], "text": "Protect six hours rather than planning eight, and prioritize key activities in the calendar."}, "title": "Calendar Optimization", "topic": "calendar management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:ca74e43ed041af06", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Calendar Optimization", "topic": "calendar management", "topic_slug": "calendar-management"}
