outube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Tracking Talk Minutes", "topic": "sales discipline", "topic_slug": "sales-discipline"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "A money making activity is when you're talking to a stranger who could potentially buy something from you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"}], "text": "A money-making activity for a real estate agent is when they talk to a stranger with potential buying intent."}, "title": "Identifying Money-Making Activities", "topic": "prioritization"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:68841c74bf46230b", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Identifying Money-Making Activities", "topic": "prioritization", "topic_slug": "prioritization"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "You don't have a time management problem. You never did. You fell into the same trap as everyone coming into this industry from outside. You had a priority.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "You do not have a time management problem; you have a priority problem."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "you'll probably watched more self-training than a guy in your office who is closing every month. You're often the busiest person in the room, in early, out late, answering messages at midnight.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002"}], "text": "A general misconception exists among agents regarding their workload and productivity."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "One, if you're in the first six months...", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002"}], "text": "Identify three main challenges hindering success."}, "title": "Discussing Misconceptions in Real Estate", "topic": "real estate performance perception"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:cases:c442d3ec0a63f883", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Discussing Misconceptions in Real Estate", "topic": "real estate performance perception", "topic_slug": "real-estate-performance-perception"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "you're missing some secret closing technique. You're not.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002"}, {"quote": "You're often the busiest person", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000002"}, {"quote": "I will share with you three things in this video.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000003"}], "text": "The speaker first addresses common misconceptions regarding low productivity, then outlines a three-part plan to address these issues."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Framing Time Management Issues", "topic": "time management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:expression:363b0beb04bb0f01", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Framing Time Management Issues", "topic": "time management", "topic_slug": "time-management"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000007"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Imagine it's eleven thirty AM, twenty minutes before lunch, thirty leads in front of you and open a serum, you check WhatsApp, you scroll the portals, maybe there is some new inventory.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000007"}], "text": "The speaker uses a hypothetical scenario about an agent’s day to illustrate ineffective time use, stating actions and their purposes."}, "purpose": {"citations": [{"quote": "You're not procrastinating. Your brain is protecting you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000007"}], "text": "Illustrate non-productive tasks during peak times and why it happens."}, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Explaining an Agent’s Ineffective Workday", "topic": "task management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:expression:4dda285283cddb34", "metadata_hash": "b2fb6de53d495fd78391bed971eafb60628a06c6aff8170a424d12c7d4b7ca0e", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Explaining an Agent’s Ineffective Workday", "topic": "task management", "topic_slug": "task-management"}
